      <h1 style="font-size: 2.2rem; margin: 10px 0 20px;">Why I Started Writing My Own Blog</h1>
      
      <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
        As a Computer Science & Engineering student, most of my days are spent learning algorithms, 
        writing code, and preparing for exams. While technical skills are essential, I wanted a 
        personal space where I could slow down, reflect, and share my own voice.
      </p>
      <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;">
        Writing helps turn scattered thoughts into clear ideas. Whether it is a lesson learned from 
        a tough project, a book that changed my perspective, or thoughts on college life in Bengaluru, 
        this blog is my digital notebook.
      </p>
      <p>
        Instead of using a pre-made blogging site, I decided to code this platform myself—combining 
        my love for writing with my passion for web development.
      </p>
